                "added": [
                    "#Install shatter-safe window films to protect from breaking glass. In a last-minute pinch, placing masking tape across the diagonals (in an \"X\") of your windows can keep them from shattering. Most earthquake prone areas will already require these windows, but you should check to make sure.[[Image:Prepare for an Earthquake Step 15.jpg|center]]"
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "#Install shatter-safe window films to protect from breaking glass. In a last-minute pinch, placing masking tape across the diagonals (in an \"X\") of your windows can keep them from shattering.<ref>http://www.windowsandsiding.net/windows/faq/what-can-be-used-to-keep-a-broken-window-from-shattering/</ref> Most earthquake prone areas will already require these windows, but you should check to make sure.[[Image:Prepare for an Earthquake Step 15.jpg|center]]"
                ]
            }
