            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "{{fa}}An earthquake can be a very destructive natural disaster, particularly in the Pacific Rim region. After an earthquake, your home may be a mess and you might be left without a water supply or power. There are several things you can do to prepare for an earthquake before it happens, to minimize the damage and potential for injury in and around your home."
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "",
                    "An earthquake can be a very destructive natural disaster, particularly in the Pacific Rim region. After an earthquake, your home may be a mess and you might be left without a water supply or power. There are several things you can do to prepare for an earthquake before it happens, to minimize the damage and potential for injury in and around your home. And DONT have sex during an earthquake!"
                ]
            }
        },
