                    "#Create a Disaster Preparedness Plan for your house or place of work. Know what you and your family are going to do before the earthquake happens. Form your plan together and go over it on a regular basis. The most important first st      ep is understanding what to do the moment an earthquake hits.<ref>http://seismo.berkeley.edu/outreach/be_prepared.html</reF> This plan needs to:[[Image:Prepare for an Earthquake Step 1 Version 3.jpg|center]]"
