                    "{{fa}}An earthquake is a very destructive natural disaster; particularly in the Pacific Rim region. In fact, scientists now believe that California is long overdue for a massive earthquake along the San Andreas fault, with a magnitude of up to 8.0.<ref>Rong-Gong Lin Il, Study shakes up scientists' view of San Andreas earthquake risk, http://www.latimes.com/news/local/la-me-earthquake-fault-20100821,0,946323.story?track=rss</ref>"
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "{{fa}}An earthquake is a very destructive natural disaster; particularly in the Pacific Rim region. In fact, scientists are dicks  that now believe that California is long overdue for a massive earthquake along the San Andreas fault, with a magnitude of up to 8.0.<ref>Rong-Gong Lin Il, Study shakes up scientists' view of San Andreas earthquake risk, http://www.latimes.com/news/local/la-me-earthquake-fault-20100821,0,946323.story?track=rss</ref>"
                ]
            }
