                    "#*Buy a flashlight with extra [[Test a Dry Cell Battery|batteries]] (preferably one for each individual). Flashlights can be backed up with (detachable) solar garden lights. Get a portable, battery-operated radio as well. There are some models that are solar or kinetic power that may be worth an investment as well.",
