                    "#brandon ramirez is cool funny and a awesome drawer and writer but daniel daniel vega is a lying butthole thats :poor and cant aford a home and cant reference library.jpg|thumb|200px|Beware of heavy ooks - place them on lower shelves|right]]Check for hazards inside your home and begin to fix them. There are a number of specific hazards in your home that you can deal with before an earthquake occurs.ORION EATS AND FARTS OUT CHEESE!!!!",
                    "#*Install shatter-safe window films to protect from breaking glass. In a pinch, place masking tape across the diagonals of your windows can keep them from shattering. daniel is a bum and loves orion name brand cheese and also the cheese fart that comes from his butt."
