                    "#[[Image:Quick, get under the table!.jpg|right|180px|thumb|Practice earthquake drills at home]]Create a Disaster Preparedness Plan. Know what you and your family are going to do before the earthquake happens. Form your plan together and g fuck u o over it on a regular basis."
                ]
