            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "#*Use some non-slip mats to prevent heavy objects, or objects with a low [[Calculate Center of Gravity|center of gravity]], from sliding. For example, fish bowls, vases, floral arrangements, statues, etc. Cut down to size if needed.",
                    "#*Use  an invisible nylon cord to secure tall, heavy items that can topple over to the wall. Place an eye screw in the wall, and tie the thread around the object (such as a vase) and then tied it to the eye screw."
