                    "[[Image:Paso Robles Earthquake 4744.jpg|right|250px]]An earthquake is a very dangerous natural disaster, particularly in the Pacific Rim region. In fact, scientists now believe that the highly populated Southern Californian area is long overdue for a massive earthquake along the San Andreas fault.<ref>Rong-Gong Lin Il, Study shakes up scientists' view of San Andreas earthquake risk, http://www.latimes.com/news/local/la-me-earthquake-fault-20100821,0,946323.story?track=rss</ref>"
